      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If this were implemented, I propose adding a overide/custom cubemap option, because some worlds may start in a box, have animations or effects during start, or are not very appealing where the player actually starts/spawns. \n\nI think VRChat would probably add a capture option to make the cubemap, just like how you take a photo from within Unity to use for your world's thumbnail.",
